processing-restoration-help = Offline classical restoration: stationary spectral subtraction, a captured noise-only profile, or adaptive noise estimation. Hum notches and short impulse repair are independent controls. Off bypasses spectral reduction only; disable hum/impulse or set wet to zero for original audio. Choose a noise-only time range below for Profile, then start a new task.
