processing-neural-help = Use explicitly prepared local model manifests and independent Python environments. Speech enhancement accepts mono/stereo; stereo channels are processed independently and the stereo image may change. Separation accepts stereo only; mono/multichannel is rejected, never duplicated or downmixed. Configure paths and apply each edited field before starting. Model errors are reported; there is no classical fallback.
