processing-graph-independent = Graph nodes own independent settings and algorithms. The live monitor EQ on the Equalizer tab is separate; editing it does not edit graph EQ nodes.
processing-graph-editor-help = Drag a node header to move it. Middle-drag or scroll to pan; Ctrl+scroll or +/− to zoom; Home resets the view. Tab to a node, Enter selects; arrows move it (Shift: larger steps), Alt+arrows pan. Ctrl+D duplicates, Delete removes, Ctrl+Z / Ctrl+Shift+Z undo/redo. Tab to an output port and press Enter, then Tab to an input and press Enter to connect. Escape cancels a drag or pending connection. Removing a node only disconnects its edges.
